":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[46,53,74,71,82,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030705","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[46,53,74,71,82,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030705","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[46,53,74,71,82,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030705","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[46,53,74,71,82,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030705","helmet":"WP1012202"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国外戚曹文叔之妻，因父亲名为夏侯令而被称此名。虽丈夫早年病逝，但无子女，因此家族多次劝其寻新夫，性格刚烈的夏侯令女用割下自己右耳的行为表达抗议，家族又劝其再婚时，又割下部分鼻尖表示决心。此事传至司马懿耳中后颇为感慨，便命其可收养他子为继者。","tc":"魏國外戚曹文叔之妻，因父親名為夏侯令而被稱此名。雖丈夫早年病逝，但無子女，因此家族多次勸其尋新夫，性格剛烈的夏侯令女用割下自己右耳的行為表達抗議，家族又勸其再婚時，又割下部分鼻尖表示決心。此事傳至司馬懿耳中后頗為感慨，便命其可收養他子為繼者。","en":"Wife of the Wei imperial kinsman Cao Wenshu, known by this name because her father was named Xiahou Ling. Though her husband died young and they had no children, her family repeatedly urged her to remarry. The strong-willed Xiahou Lingnu cut off her own right ear in protest. When her family pressed her again, she sliced off part of her nose to demonstrate her resolve. When Sima Yi learned of this, he was deeply moved and permitted her to adopt another's child as heir.","jp":"魏の外戚である曹文叔の妻。父の名が夏侯令であったことからこう呼ばれる。夫が早くに病死し、子がいなかったため、家族から幾度も再婚を勧められたが、性格が剛烈な夏侯令女は自らの右耳を削ぎ落として抗議した。家族が再び再婚を勧めると、今度は鼻の先を削ぎ落として固い決意を示した。このことが司馬懿の耳に入ると深く感服し、他家の子を養子に迎えて後継ぎとすることを認めた。","kr":"위나라 외척 조문숙의 아내로, 부친의 이름이 하후영이었기에 이 이름으로 불렸다. 남편이 일찍 병사하고 자식도 없자 가문에서 여러 차례 개가를 권했으나, 성격이 강직했던 하후영녀는 자신의 오른쪽 귀를 자르며 항의의 뜻을 표했다. 가문에서 다시 재가를 권하자 또다시 코끝을 베어내어 굳은 결의를 보였다. 이 일이 사마의의 귀에 들어가자 사마의는 몹시 감탄하며 다른 아이를 양자로 삼아 대를 잇도록 명하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10227","remark":"","surname":"夏侯","surnameTc":"夏侯","surnameEn":"Xiahou","surnameJp":"夏侯","surnameKr":"하후","surnameOther":"","name":"令女","nameTc":"令女","nameEn":"Lingnu","nameJp":"令女","nameKr":"영녀","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"夏侯令女","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"221","city":"CS1026","gender":"1","rule":"46","force":"53","wise":"74","politics":"71","charm":"82","will":"86","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"13","weaponMaster":"16/16/16/16/16/70/55/16","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2100","battleSoulPoint":"2800","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1007301","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/0/0/1/1/0/0/0/0/2/1/0/0/2/1/1/0/1/0/2","attribute2":"53/59/76/81/82/90","morality":"7","compatible":"13","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"207","show":"221","death":"257","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030705","helmet":"WP1012202","tre